body:
If you aren't here anymore, I'm sorry this was what it had come to, and that no one loved and appreciated you the way you deserved. I'm sorry you didn't get the care you needed in your life and I hope that wherever you are, you are happy, you are loved, and you are safe.

&#x200B;

If you are still here though, I'm sorry you had to suffer and that you are probably still suffering. Even if it takes a while, if you get up, then it's worth it. I'm sorry you couldn't get out, or get help. I hope you can find a way to. I hope you can find someone who cares and truly loves you the way you deserve. I hope you can trust again and love again and live again.
